# Phase-6 determinism replica A — dynamic-verification config: simple_cluster truncated.
# Same physical setup as param/simple_cluster.param (mCloud 1e5 Msun, sfe 0.3,
# everything else schema default), with stop_t cut to 0.5 Myr so the run reaches
# the phase 1a -> 1b handoff in minutes instead of hours.
# Used for: determinism / global-state probe (two separate processes, byte-compare),
# the invariant scan, and the R ~ t^(3/5) asymptotic fit.
# NOT sufficient for the table-bounds sensor (TBL-01 needs t > 10 Myr).
mCloud    1e5
sfe    0.3
stop_t    0.5
